      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fogelsville%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Fogelsville once hosted the Catasauqua and Fogelsville Railroad terminus, later extended to Rittenhouse Gap, and was a key iron ore mining site for Lehigh Valley furnaces.",
